                        </div>
                        <p class="faqanswer active" id="tab-a-1">Students can fill the form with certificates that are
                            available. Later on, they can simply provide the remaining documents to the team as the
                            application processes.
                        </p>
                    </div>

                    <div class="faqquestionWrap mb30" data-rel="tab-a-2">
                        <div class="left">
                            <p class="faqHeading">Is it mandatory for students to submit their class XI marksheet?
