                        </div>
                        <p class="faqanswer font-16 font-grey13" id="tab-f-2">Mode of payment can be online, net
                            banking, bank transfer or in some rare cases they can even send a cheque. Except for cash,
                            we accept all payment methods.</p>
                    </div>

                    <div class="faqquestionWrap mb30" data-rel="tab-f-3">
                        <div class="left">
